Map:map_pk_ironvale_tunnels/Desc
"Within the Blue Mountains lies Ironvale, a fertile basin surrounded by dark cliffs and pine forests. A vast tunnel network runs beneath the rock, allowing armies to cross the battlefield unseen. At its center, a blood-stained fire burns where many have fallen. \nMap by Powerkartoffel, August 2025"
END